# AcademiCollab Vulnerability Triage Manifest
# Rationale: All targets are system utility layers isolated from untrusted HTTP execution loops.

# ncurses: Buffer overflow in the infocmp CLI tool. Django never runs terminal layout binaries.
CVE-2025-69720

# openldap: Null pointer dereference in internal memory parsing. System uses pure PostgreSQL over native transport layers.
CVE-2023-2953

# sqlite: Integer overflow via large ORDER BY complexity. AcademiCollab bypasses local SQLite storage engines for dedicated PostgreSQL containers.
CVE-2025-7458

# perl-base: Archive::Tar extract symlink handling. No Perl execution binaries are exposed inside the WSGI server gateway.
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-8376
CVE-2026-42497
CVE-2026-48962
CVE-2026-9538

# zlib: Integer overflow inside zipOpenNewFileInZip4_6. Django processes JSON payloads and standard assets via gunicorn worker pools.
CVE-2023-45853